[2026-03-14T22:42:28.479Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dn8pHykyAUzL1FNmB1931z","type":"tool_result","content":"  2008→#### Test: Overview tab renders description, milestones, and key metrics sections\n  2009→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1` with the \"Overview\" tab active. Project \"Auth Rewrite\" has a description \"Rewrite the authentication system to support OAuth and SSO\", 2 milestones, and key metrics.\n  2010→- **Expected**: The overview displays three sections: a \"Description\" section showing the project description text, a \"Milestones\" section listing milestones, and a \"Key Metrics\" section showing project statistics.\n  2011→\n  2012→#### Test: Description is inline editable\n  2013→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description is \"Rewrite the authentication system\".\n  2014→- **Action**: User clicks on the description text area.\n  2015→- **Expected**: The description becomes editable (rich text area or markdown-supporting text area). The current description text is shown and editable.\n  2016→\n  2017→#### Test: Edit and save description\n  2018→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description field is in edit mode.\n  2019→- **Action**: User clears the description, types \"Updated auth system with OAuth2 and SAML support\", and clicks away or presses a save action.\n  2020→- **Expected**: The description updates to \"Updated auth system with OAuth2 and SAML support\". The change is persisted to the database. An activity entry is created recording the description change.\n  2021→\n  2022→#### Test: Description supports markdown rendering\n  2023→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description contains markdown: \"## Goals\\n- Support OAuth\\n- Support SSO\\n\\n**Priority**: High\".\n  2024→- **Expected**: The description renders the markdown: \"Goals\" as a heading, bullet points for \"Support OAuth\" and \"Support SSO\", and \"Priority\" in bold.\n  2025→\n  2026→#### Test: Cancel description edit reverts changes\n  2027→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Description is \"Original description\".\n  2028→- **Action**: User clicks the description to edit, types \"Changed text\", then presses Escape.\n  2029→- **Expected**: The description reverts to \"Original description\". No change is persisted.\n  2030→\n  2031→#### Test: Description shows placeholder when empty\n  2032→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Project has no description.\n  2033→- **Expected**: A placeholder text is shown (e.g., \"Add a description...\") indicating the field is editable.\n  2034→\n  2035→#### Test: Milestones section displays existing milestones\n  2036→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Project has milestones: \"Alpha Release\" (target date Mar 15, 2026, completed) and \"Beta Release\" (target date Apr 1, 2026, not completed).\n  2037→- **Expected**: The milestones section shows both milestones. \"Alpha Release\" shows its target date and a completed indicator (checkmark or strikethrough). \"Beta Release\" shows its target date and an incomplete indicator.\n  2038→\n  2039→#### Test: Add a new milestone\n  2040→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestones section is visible.\n  2041→- **Action**: User clicks an \"Add Milestone\" button.\n  2042→- **Expected**: An inline form or input appears with fields for milestone name and target date. A \"Save\" and \"Cancel\" button are visible.\n  2043→\n  2044→#### Test: Save a new milestone\n  2045→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Add milestone form is visible.\n  2046→- **Action**: User enters \"GA Release\" as the milestone name, selects \"May 15, 2026\" as the target date, and clicks \"Save\".\n  2047→- **Expected**: The new milestone \"GA Release\" appears in the milestones list with target date \"May 15, 2026\" and an incomplete status. The change is persisted. An activity entry is created.\n  2048→\n  2049→#### Test: Cancel adding a new milestone\n  2050→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Add milestone form is visible with \"Draft\" entered.\n  2051→- **Action**: User clicks \"Cancel\".\n  2052→- **Expected**: The form disappears. No new milestone is added. The milestones list remains unchanged.\n  2053→\n  2054→#### Test: Toggle milestone completion status\n  2055→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Beta Release\" is not completed.\n  2056→- **Action**: User clicks the completion checkbox or toggle for \"Beta Release\".\n  2057→- **Expected**: \"Beta Release\" is marked as completed with a checkmark or completed styling. The change is persisted. An activity entry is created.\n  2058→\n  2059→#### Test: Toggle milestone back to incomplete\n  2060→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Alpha Release\" is marked as completed.\n  2061→- **Action**: User clicks the completion checkbox or toggle for \"Alpha Release\".\n  2062→- **Expected**: \"Alpha Release\" is marked as incomplete. The completed styling is removed. The change is persisted.\n  2063→\n  2064→#### Test: Delete a milestone with confirmation\n  2065→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Alpha Release\" exists.\n  2066→- **Action**: User clicks a delete button on the \"Alpha Release\" milestone.\n  2067→- **Expected**: A confirmation dialog appears (e.g., \"Are you sure you want to delete this milestone?\"). The milestone is not yet deleted.\n  2068→\n  2069→#### Test: Confirm milestone deletion\n  2070→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone delete confirmation dialog is showing for \"Alpha Release\".\n  2071→- **Action**: User clicks \"Confirm\" or \"Delete\" in the dialog.\n  2072→- **Expected**: \"Alpha Release\" is removed from the milestones list. The change is persisted. An activity entry is created.\n  2073→\n  2074→#### Test: Cancel milestone deletion\n  2075→- **Initial state**: Milestone delete confirmation dialog is showing for \"Alpha Release\".\n  2076→- **Action**: User clicks \"Cancel\" in the dialog.\n  2077→- **Expected**: The dialog closes. \"Alpha Release\" remains in the milestones list unchanged.\n  2078→\n  2079→#### Test: Edit milestone name inline\n  2080→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Beta Release\" exists.\n  2081→- **Action**: User clicks on the milestone name \"Beta Release\", changes it to \"Public Beta\", and confirms.\n  2082→- **Expected**: The milestone name updates to \"Public Beta\". The change is persisted.\n  2083→\n  2084→#### Test: Edit milestone target date\n  2085→- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Overview tab. Milestone \"Beta Release\" has target date \"Apr 1, 2026\".\n  2086→- **Action**: User clicks the target date for \"Beta Release\" and selects \"Apr 15, 2026\".\n  2087→- **Expected**: The target date updates to \"Apr 15, 2026\". The change is persisted."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0178jyNx5DhSddVzwJG9b4ur","session_id":"305e5aa9-79a1-4a8e-aa5e-6b1bfad647a9","uuid":"3cb72822-e8fb-479a-b46d-cbe715f76cc7"}
